### Health check
GET http://localhost:8080/health

### list_repos — account personal (via GITHUB_TOKEN_PERSONAL env)
POST http://localhost:8080/mcp
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "jsonrpc": "2.0",
  "id": 2,
  "method": "tools/call",
  "params": {
    "name": "list_repos",
    "arguments": {
      "account": "personal",
      "type": "owner",
      "page": 1
    }
  }
}

### list_repos — solo repo pubblici
POST http://localhost:8080/mcp
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "jsonrpc": "2.0",
  "id": 3,
  "method": "tools/call",
  "params": {
    "name": "list_repos",
    "arguments": {
      "account": "personal",
      "type": "public"
    }
  }
}

### create_issue — issue base senza labels
POST http://localhost:8080/mcp
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "jsonrpc": "2.0",
  "id": 3,
  "method": "tools/call",
  "params": {
    "name": "create_issue",
    "arguments": {
      "account": "personal",
      "repo": "DaniFX/mcp-dev-hub",
      "title": "Test issue da MCP tool",
      "body": "Questa issue è stata creata automaticamente dal tool `create_issue` del server MCP."
    }
  }
}

### create_issue — con labels e assignees
POST http://localhost:8080/mcp
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "jsonrpc": "2.0",
  "id": 4,
  "method": "tools/call",
  "params": {
    "name": "create_issue",
    "arguments": {
      "account": "personal",
      "repo": "DaniFX/mcp-dev-hub",
      "title": "Bug: endpoint /mcp non risponde",
      "body": "## Descrizione\n\nL'endpoint `/mcp` restituisce 500 in certi casi.\n\n## Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Avvia il server\n2. Invia una richiesta malformata\n3. Osserva il 500",
      "labels": ["bug"],
      "assignees": ["DaniFX"]
    }
  }
}

### create_issue — test errore: repo mancante
POST http://localhost:8080/mcp
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "jsonrpc": "2.0",
  "id": 5,
  "method": "tools/call",
  "params": {
    "name": "create_issue",
    "arguments": {
      "account": "personal",
      "title": "Issue senza repo"
    }
  }
}

### create_issue — test errore: account non esistente
POST http://localhost:8080/mcp
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "jsonrpc": "2.0",
  "id": 6,
  "method": "tools/call",
  "params": {
    "name": "create_issue",
    "arguments": {
      "account": "nonexistent",
      "repo": "DaniFX/mcp-dev-hub",
      "title": "Test"
    }
  }
}

### tool non esistente (test errore)
POST http://localhost:8080/mcp
X-API-Key: changeme
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "jsonrpc": "2.0",
  "id": 4,
  "method": "tools/call",
  "params": {
    "name": "unknown_tool",
    "arguments": {}
  }
}
